
>> shop := (Simi-taqi musuq
	churay: ['magazine'] maypi: ['books'],
	churay: ['computer'] maypi: ['electronics'],
	churay: ['lipstick'] maypi: ['cosmetics']
).
Lluqsiy qillqay: (shop kanmi: ['computer']), sayay. 
Lluqsiy qillqay: (shop kanmi: ['sausage']), sayay. 
Lluqsiy qillqay: (shop kanmi: ['computers']), sayay. 
Lluqsiy qillqay: (shop kanmi: ['compute']), sayay. 
Lluqsiy qillqay: (shop kanmi: ['2computer']), sayay. 
